WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit beside a bolster and lie over it on your side.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Extend the top arm overhead if comfortable.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Soften the face and jaw.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Stay for several breaths.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Come up carefully and switch.
